      },
      "message": "docs(site): reference for the 2D milling operations\n\nOne section per 2D milling and hole kind on main (Face, 2D Contour,\n2D Pocket, 2D Adaptive, 2D Offset, Slot, Trochoidal slot, Trace,\nEngrave, 2D Chamfer, Circular, Thread, Drill, Bore): purpose and when\nto choose it over a neighbour, key settings by tab with the seeded\ndefaults, geometry picks, and common refusal messages, all read from\nthe source. Linked from the Operations page; the Milling 2D row there\ngains Trochoidal slot; posting/refusals weights shift by one.\n\nRefs #1250\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
